Cell["\<\
Interpretaci\[OAcute]n para nor o nand: 
La negaci\[OAcute]n de cada variable, ser\[IAcute]a !p = p\[Nor]p, entonces \
se quedar\[IAcute]a (p\[Nor]p)\[Nor]r\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9709851651613483`*^9, 3.970985181565855*^9}, {
